  "text": "Dr. Elizabeth McNiel, DVM, PhD, DACVIM (Oncology) | ARISE Veterinary Center - Queen Creek\nSkip to Primary Content\nJoin Our Team\nJoin Our Team\nMap\n21419 S Ellsworth Rd.,\nQueen Creek,\nAZ,\n85142\nCall\n(480) 746-6600\nEmergency Services\nEmergency Services\nPhone:\n(480) 746-6600\nAddress:\n21419 S Ellsworth Rd.,\nQueen Creek,\nAZ,\n85142\nHome\nView AVECCC Locations\nAbout Us\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nARISE VetCare Fund\nCommunity Events\nSpecialty Services\nBlood Donor Program\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nHemodialysis & Extracorporeal Therapies\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology\nRadiology Service\nSurgery\nView All Services\nReferring Veterinarians\nRDVM Portal\nForms\nMaterials Request\nClients\nPatient History Form\nFinancing Options\nARISE Academy\nEmergency Services\nJoin Our Team\nBoard-Certified Oncologist\nDr. Elizabeth McNiel, DVM, PhD, DACVIM (Oncology)\nBoard-Certified Oncologist\nDr. Elizabeth McNiel, DVM, PhD, DACVIM (Oncology)\nDr. Elizabeth McNiel is a board-certified veterinary medical and radiation oncologist with extensive experience in both academic and clinical settings. She earned her DVM from Texas A&M University, completed advanced training through a medical oncology residency at Colorado State University, and received a PhD in radiation biology alongside clinical training in radiation oncology. After 15 years in academia at leading institutions including the University of Minnesota, Michigan State University, and Tufts University, she transitioned to pharmaceutical research to help develop innovative therapies for animals and people. Dr. McNiel has since returned to clinical practice, where she is dedicated to helping pets with cancer maintain the highest possible quality of life while guiding families with compassionate care and clear treatment options.\nARISE Veterinary Center\n21419 S Ellsworth Rd.\nQueen Creek\n,\nAZ\n85142\nT:\n(480) 746-6600\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nSpecialty services available Monday – Friday by appointment. Urgent cases call for same day availability.\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nEmergency Services\nSpecialty Services\nReferring Veterinarians\nHome\nTerms & Conditions\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
